.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
IDE.log
.analytics
repomix-output.txt

# --- HLS synthesis: commit ONLY csynth reports (**/syn/report/), bỏ RTL sinh ra & file build ---
**/syn/verilog/
**/syn/vhdl/
**/syn/systemc/
**/solution1/*.aps
**/solution1/*.directive
**/sol/*.aps
**/sol/*.directive
**/*.pid
**/.cosim_pid
**/.csim_pid
**/.cosim_textmode_pid
