# --- HLS build metadata (không phải report, không cần repo) ---
**/kernel.xml
**/*_data.json
**/*.aps
**/prj_csim*/

# --- Quant test data dump (giống convention model_params/io_params) ---
**/model_params_q/*.txt
**/io_params_q/*.txt
/test.txt

# --- HLS probe build dirs (giữ source mac_probe.cpp/run_probe.tcl, bỏ build) ---
**/mac_probe/prj_*/

# --- Large / local-only (không đẩy lên repo) ---
/assets.zip
/HLS/
/data/

# --- Board debug scripts (local-only, not for repo) ---
**/run_*.sh
**/run_*.tcl
read_output.tcl
copy_to_sdcard.sh

# --- HLS generated TCL (auto-generated, not for repo) ---
**/inferred_directives.tcl

